From ub74406a12280246a at groups.google.com  Mon Jul  9 14:48:21 2018
From: ub74406a12280246a at groups.google.com (Virginia Morera Pujol)
Date: Mon, 09 Jul 2018 14:48:21 +0000
Subject: fitted values change in the same model with/without prediction stack
Message-ID: <fFr7bIAR-6s.UFNxYRWoBQAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/fFr7bIAR-6s/m/UFNxYRWoBQAJ>
