MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Running time tends to depend more on the model size than the number of observations. What is your model structure, and in what way does it grow with the number of observations?
Often the limiting factor is memory, which increases with the number of threads, so sometimes reducing the number of allowed threads can actually speed things up.

Finn

