Dear all,

We have at least two upcoming INLA courses that are open for registration:

https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/spatial-modelling-with-r-inla-workshop-tickets-48024306995

This course is very applied, with a strong focus on landslides. We will not discuss deep statistical concepts, or the inner workings of the INLA algorithm.

http://www.zhrcourses.uzh.ch/en/programm/Bayesian-inference-using-R-INLA.html

This course focuses on the practical use of INLA, but includes quite a bit of information on the statistical concepts and the inner workings of INLA.

Please add other INLA courses below (but only those open to registration by anyone).

Kind regards,

Haakon

